      "writtenOn": "2020-09-08T17:27:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Then why test for this property? This has nothing to do with the behavior of the implementation under test. Callers may not rely on the state of the out parameters if the call failed for any reason, period.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 72,
        "startChar": 4,
