        "id": 1589008
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-15T14:57:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I made this comment to clarify why I am clearing these variables, because they can be left uncleared from previous test, and I want the test to start clean.\n\nWhen aidl we know the variables are not suppose to be set when test failed, so I don\u0027t see why we can\u0027t check the output to be 0.",
      "parentUuid": "11db6b2b_97bdc587",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 72,
        "startChar": 4,
