        "uuid": "ee5328ca_4eb2aeab",
        "filename": "keymint/aidl/vts/functional/KeyMintAidlTestBase.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 27
      },
      "lineNbr": 179,
      "author": {
        "id": 1092085
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-08T17:27:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am writing this here because I noticed just now, but it is true for all other functions that evaluate serviceSepcificErrorCode().\n\nserviceSepcificErrorCode returns the service specific error code only if the exception code is SERVICE_SPECIFIC. In all other cases it returns 0. This means if you just cast this to ErrorCode, this function will return OK (0) even if another exception situation occurred.\n\nSo if .isOk() returns false, you should first evaluate the .exceptionCode(). If that is EX_SERVICE_SPECIFIC you may use result.serviceSpecificErrorCode(). If it is EX_TRANSACTION_FAILED you may use result.transactionError() in any other case the exception code is all you get.\n\nSo I would map\n * .isOk() \u003d\u003d true on ErrorCode::OK.\n * .exceptionCode() \u003d\u003d EX_SERVICE_SPECIFIC on static_cast\u003cErrorCode\u003e(result.serviceSpecificErrorCode())\n * every other case on ErrorCode::UNKNOWN_ERROR",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 179,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 179,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "87210349393148aaf6b4075070fe54d4e7bbee51",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7186d7e5_46e3f244",
        "filename": "keymint/aidl/vts/functional/KeyMintAidlTestBase.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 27
      },
      "lineNbr": 179,
      "author": {
        "id": 1589008
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-15T14:57:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.  but we actually always return just service specific errors or OK.  We don\u0027t return anything else.",
      "parentUuid": "ee5328ca_4eb2aeab",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 179,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 179,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "87210349393148aaf6b4075070fe54d4e7bbee51",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
