      "message": "this variable is unused.\n\nNit: Since token is only valid if error is OK. You could use std::variant\u003cErrorCode, VerificationToken\u003e Instead of VerifyAuthorizationResult.\n\nAt the call site you can use it like this:\n\n auto result \u003d verifyAuthorization(...);\n if (auto token_ptr \u003d result.get_if\u003cVerificationToken\u003e()) {\n \n } else if (auto error_ptr \u003d result.get_if\u003cErrorCode\u003e()) {\n \n }",
